  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "I feel strange being put in this position",
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Her wellbeing after all that late-night work does matter to me",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "more than I can say clearly right now."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "This whole situation makes me uneasy.",
