    "ae_welfare_concern": "that possibility troubles me."
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "Her getting fairly paid does matter to me",
    "pda_responsibility": "I don't want to be the reason she walks away shortchanged",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "after we did equal work together."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "It's hard to sit with this kind of choice.",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "her effort mattered that night, same as mine",
